                                <Paragraph>
                                  <TextRuns>
                                    <TextRun>
                                      <Value>Specification of requirement by the requestor according to defined standards/needs of the branch or department responsible. It's an Initiation of all relevant needs for sourcing process, according to defined thresholdsby the requestor. The requirement must be approved by Head of Department/SBU  responsible. Necessary additional approvals/concurrence with other section heads/approvers have to be collected before submitting to procurement.</Value>
                                      <Style>
                                        <FontFamily>Century Gothic</FontFamily>
                                        <FontSize>8pt</FontSize>
                                      </Style>
